| `approximate_output_is_locked` | ok | ok |

Suite totals: `emit_coverage` **4 passed / 0 failed** on base, **3 / 1** on
head; `corpus_integration` **12 / 1** on both, the one failure being the
pre-existing `approximate_finds_classic_madgab_resegmentation`, i.e. the
