* **Repetition.** The whole head suite was run three times end to end: the same
  single test fails each time, with the identical message
  (`the word "hid" is absent from the pool entirely, so the pool assertion
  above is vacuous for it`) and identical wall clock (10.90 s / 8.76 s / 9.38 s).
